---
title: "AD-04 Runner Executes a Job (UML Activity Diagram)"
---
flowchart TB
  start((●)) --> a1[Long-poll for a job]
  a1 --> d1{Job received?}
  d1 -- no --> a1
  d1 -- yes --> a2[Create workspace]
  a2 --> a3[Download artifacts from needed jobs]
  a3 --> a4[Next step]
  a4 --> d2{Step condition true?}
  d2 -- no --> sk[Mark step skipped] --> d5
  d2 -- yes --> d3{Built-in action?}
  d3 -- yes --> b1[Run built-in: checkout / upload / download / release / package]
  d3 -- no --> b2[Interpolate expressions, render script for shell]
  b2 --> b3[Start process in group / Job Object]
  b3 --> b4[Stream masked output to server]
  b4 --> d4{Cancel flag received?}
  d4 -- yes --> k[Kill process tree] --> fin
  d4 -- no --> b5[Wait for exit code]
  b1 --> r[Record step result]
  b5 --> r
  r --> d6{Step failed and not continue-on-error?}
  d6 -- yes --> fail[Job result = failure]
  d6 -- no --> d5{More steps?}
  d5 -- yes --> a4
  d5 -- no --> okk[Job result = success]
  fail --> al[Run 'always' steps e.g. after_script]
  okk --> up[Upload artifacts per 'when' rule]
  al --> up
  up --> fin[Report finish]
  fin --> cl[Delete workspace]
  cl --> a1
